## Learning Approach

For each major concept:

1. Understand the intuition
2. Learn the underlying mathematics where required
3. Explain the concept in my own words
4. Implement the concept where appropriate
5. Experiment with different scenarios
6. Document key observations
7. Commit the work to GitHub

